# Crude Rampart's ruling (2004-10-04): if it attacks face down and is turned face up during combat, that does not remove it
# from combat - defender only stops it being declared as an attacker (CR 702.3b), and turning face up changes only its
# characteristics, never its combat status (CR 708.8, 506.4). On turn 3 the face-down 2/2 attacks; in the declare attackers
# step five Moxes pay the {4}{W} to turn it up, and the 4/5 with defender stays attacking and deals 4.

